Project Abstract

ComicCraft is an AI-based comic story creation application that uses Gemini models to convert a simple story idea into a structured comic storyboard.

The application automatically generates characters, narration, dialogue and connected panels, reducing the effort required for initial comic story planning.

Objectives

The main objectives are:

* Make comic story creation easier.
* Demonstrate the practical use of Generative AI.
* Use structured AI output in a real application.
* Provide a simple interactive web interface.
* Allow users to export generated comic content.

Advantages

* Easy to use
* Fast story generation
* Customizable genre
* Customizable panel count
* Structured AI output
* JSON and HTML export
* Beginner-friendly

Limitations

* Requires internet access.
* Requires a valid Gemini API key.
* AI-generated content may contain errors.
* Generated output needs human review.
* Current version generates storyboard text and scene descriptions rather than finished comic artwork.
* Gemini API/model availability may change.

Future Enhancements

Future versions can include:

* AI-generated comic panel artwork
* Character consistency between panels
* Speech-bubble rendering
* PDF comic export
* User accounts
* Saved comics
* Multiple language support
* Individual panel editing and regeneration
